      <Node Name="DeadEnds" Category="Main" Bounds="800,100" Id="VEFxAnmW9SLZfZvbI9EtiM" Summary="Keeps the tips (From, To) whose To is touched by exactly one street end - itself. A dead end is a degree-1 node.">
