            </Node>
            <Pad Id="KKzlMcJuKR9dWdPrtfgBPP" Bounds="380,60,320,90" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="For each tip the inner loop keeps the street ends within 1 m of its To and counts them. One means only the tip itself is there: a dead end; Keep drops the rest. There is no = for Vector2 - a distance under 1 m on a 60 m grid IS equality. O(n squared), which is why the caller wraps this in a Cache.">
